  "display_title": "An Appetite for First Love",
  "description": "A decade ago, Chae Songhwa and her friend Seo Hyunwoo promised to meet again as their best selves. Unfortunately, life hasn’t quite turned out the way Songhwa imagined. So when they meet again at their high school reunion, Songhwa is stunned to find that Hyunwoo remembers her and wants to reconnect. One meal and a little too much wine later, he asks her to take him home, where the night takes a spicy turn. Are they simply spicing up their bland lives? Or is this the start of a delicious romance?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Natjyeobami Danpyeonseon (낮져밤이 단편선) Collection.*",
